#: ../../upstream/docs/user/subprojects.rst:2
msgid "Subprojects"
msgstr "子项目"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/subprojects.rst:4
msgid ""
"In this article, you can learn more about how several documentation projects"
" can be combined and presented to the reader on the same website."
msgstr "本文介绍如何将多个文档项目组合起来，在同一网站上呈现给读者。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/subprojects.rst:6
msgid ""
"Read the Docs can be configured to make other *projects* available on the "
"website of the *main project* as **subprojects**. This allows for "
"documentation projects to share a search index and a namespace or custom "
"domain, but still be maintained independently."
msgstr ""
"Read the Docs 可配置为在*主项目* 网站上以**子项目** 形式提供其他*项目* "
"。这让文档项目可共享搜索索引和命名空间或自定义域名，同时仍独立维护。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/subprojects.rst:10
msgid "This is useful for:"
msgstr "适用于："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/subprojects.rst:12
msgid ""
"Organizations that need all their projects visible in one documentation "
"portal or landing page"
msgstr "需要在一个文档门户或落地页中展示全部项目的组织"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/subprojects.rst:13
msgid "Projects that document and release several packages or extensions"
msgstr "需要为多个包或扩展提供文档并发布的项目"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/subprojects.rst:14
msgid ""
"Organizations or projects that want to have a common search function for "
"several sets of documentation"
msgstr "希望多套文档共享统一搜索功能的组织或项目"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/subprojects.rst:16
msgid ""
"For a main project ``example-project``, a subproject ``example-project-"
"plugin`` can be made available as follows:"
msgstr "对于主项目 ``example-project`` ，子项目 ``example-project-plugin`` 可按如下方式提供："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/subprojects.rst:18
msgid "Main project: ``https://example-project.readthedocs.io/en/latest/``"
msgstr "主项目：``https://example-project.readthedocs.io/en/latest/``"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/subprojects.rst:19
msgid ""
"Subproject: ``https://example-"
"project.readthedocs.io/projects/plugin/en/latest/``"
msgstr "子项目：``https://example-project.readthedocs.io/projects/plugin/en/latest/``"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/subprojects.rst:23
msgid ":doc:`/guides/subprojects`"
msgstr ":doc:`/guides/subprojects`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/subprojects.rst:24
msgid "Learn how to create and manage subprojects"
msgstr "了解如何创建和管理子项目"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/subprojects.rst:26
msgid ":doc:`/guides/intersphinx`"
msgstr ":doc:`/guides/intersphinx`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/subprojects.rst:27
msgid ""
"Learn how to use references between different Sphinx projects, for instance "
"between subprojects"
msgstr "了解如何在不同 Sphinx 项目之间使用引用，例如子项目之间"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/subprojects.rst:31
msgid "Sharing a custom domain"
msgstr "共享自定义域名"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/subprojects.rst:33
msgid ""
"Projects and subprojects can be used to share a custom domain. To configure "
"this, one project should be established as the main project and configured "
"with a custom domain. Other projects are then added as subprojects to the "
"main project."
msgstr "项目和子项目可用于共享自定义域名。配置时，需将一个项目设为主项目并为其配置自定义域名，然后将其余项目作为子项目添加到主项目。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/subprojects.rst:37
msgid ""
"If the example project ``example-project`` was set up with a custom domain, "
"``docs.example.com``, the URLs for projects ``example-project`` and "
"``example-project-plugin`` with alias ``plugin`` would respectively be at:"
msgstr ""
"若示例项目 ``example-project`` 使用自定义域名 ``docs.example.com`` 设置，则项目 ``example-"
"project`` 和别名为 ``plugin`` 的 ``example-project-plugin`` 的 URL 分别为："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/subprojects.rst:41
msgid "``example-project``: ``https://docs.example.com/en/latest/``"
msgstr "``example-project`` ：``https://docs.example.com/en/latest/``"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/subprojects.rst:42
msgid ""
"``example-project-plugin``: "
"``https://docs.example.com/projects/plugin/en/latest/``"
msgstr ""
"``example-project-plugin`` "
"：``https://docs.example.com/projects/plugin/en/latest/``"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/subprojects.rst:45
msgid "Using aliases"
msgstr "使用别名"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/subprojects.rst:47
msgid ""
"Adding an alias for the subproject allows you to override the URL that is "
"used to access it, giving more control over how you want to structure your "
"projects. You can choose an alias for the subproject when it is created."
msgstr "为子项目添加别名可覆盖访问它的 URL，让你更能掌控项目结构。创建子项目时即可选择别名。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/subprojects.rst:51
msgid ""
"You can set your subproject's project name and :term:`slug` however you "
"want, but we suggest prefixing it with the name of the main project."
msgstr "你可以任意设置子项目的项目名称和 :term:`slug` ，但我们建议加上主项目名称作为前缀。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/subprojects.rst:54
msgid ""
"Typically, a subproject is created with a ``<mainproject>-`` prefix, for "
"instance if the main project is called ``example-project`` and the "
"subproject is called ``plugin``, then the subproject's Read the Docs project"
" :term:`slug` will be ``example-project-plugin``. When adding the "
"subproject, the alias is set to ``plugin`` and the project's URL becomes "
"``example-project.readthedocs.io/projects/plugin``."
msgstr ""
"通常子项目创建时带 ``<mainproject>-`` 前缀。例如主项目名为 ``example-project`` 、子项目名为 "
"``plugin`` 时，子项目的 Read the Docs 项目 :term:`slug` 为 ``example-project-plugin``"
" 。添加子项目时别名设为 ``plugin`` ，项目 URL 变为 ``example-"
"project.readthedocs.io/projects/plugin`` 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/subprojects.rst:61
msgid ""
"When you add a subproject, the subproject will not be directly available "
"anymore from its own domain. For instance, ``example-project-"
"plugin.readthedocs.io/`` will redirect to ``example-"
"project.readthedocs.io/projects/plugin``."
msgstr ""
"添加子项目后，子项目不再能通过自身域名直接访问。例如 ``example-project-plugin.readthedocs.io/`` 会重定向到 "
"``example-project.readthedocs.io/projects/plugin`` 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/subprojects.rst:67
msgid ":doc:`/url-path-prefixes`"
msgstr ":doc:`/url-path-prefixes`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/subprojects.rst:68
msgid ""
"On |com_brand| Pro plans and higher, you can customize the ``/projects/`` "
"prefix or remove it entirely."
msgstr "在 |com_brand| Pro 及以上套餐中，你可以自定义 ``/projects/`` 前缀或完全移除它。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/subprojects.rst:72
msgid "Custom domain on subprojects"
msgstr "子项目的自定义域名"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/subprojects.rst:74
msgid ""
"Adding a custom domain to a subproject is not allowed, since your "
"documentation will always be served from the domain of the parent project."
msgstr "不允许为子项目添加自定义域名，因为文档始终从父项目的域名提供。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/subprojects.rst:79
msgid "Separate release cycles"
msgstr "独立发布周期"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/subprojects.rst:81
msgid ""
"By using subprojects, you can present the documentation of several projects "
"even though they have separate release cycles."
msgstr "通过子项目，即使多个项目有各自的发布周期，也能统一呈现其文档。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/subprojects.rst:85
msgid ""
"Your main project may have its own versions and releases, while all of its "
"subprojects maintain their own individual versions and releases. We "
"recommend that documentation follows the release cycle of whatever it is "
"documenting, meaning that your subprojects should be free to follow their "
"own release cycle."
msgstr "主项目可以有自己的版本和发布，而其所有子项目则各自维护独立版本与发布。我们建议文档遵循其所记录对象的发布周期，即子项目应能自主遵循自己的发布周期。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/subprojects.rst:90
msgid ""
"This is solved by having an individual :term:`flyout menu` active for the "
"project that's viewed. When the user navigates to a subproject, they are "
"presented with a flyout menu matching the subproject's versions and :doc"
":`/offline-formats`."
msgstr ""
"这通过为所查看的项目启用独立的 :term:`flyout menu` 解决。用户导航到子项目时，会看到与该子项目版本和 :doc:`/offline-"
"formats` 相匹配的浮出菜单。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/subprojects.rst:95
msgid "Search"
msgstr "搜索"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/subprojects.rst:97
msgid ""
"Search on the parent project will include results from its subprojects, and "
"readers can filter results by subproject from the search modal. If you "
"search on the ``v1`` version of the parent project, results from the ``v1`` "
"version of its subprojects will be included, or from the default version for"
" subprojects that don't have a ``v1`` version."
msgstr ""
"在父项目上搜索会包含其子项目的结果，读者可在搜索弹窗中按子项目筛选结果。若在父项目的 ``v1`` 版本上搜索，会包含其子项目 ``v1`` "
"版本的结果；对于没有 ``v1`` 版本的子项目则使用其默认版本。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/subprojects.rst:103
msgid ""
"This is currently the only way to share search results between projects, we "
"do not yet support sharing search results between sibling subprojects or "
"arbitrary projects."
msgstr "这目前是项目间共享搜索结果的唯一方式，我们尚不支持在同级子项目或任意项目之间共享搜索结果。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/subprojects.rst:106
msgid ""
"The subprojects filter in the search modal can be turned off from the parent"
" project's :menuselection:`Settings --> Search`, by disabling "
":guilabel:`Show subprojects filter in search modal`."
msgstr ""
"可在父项目的 :menuselection:`Settings --> Search` 中禁用 :guilabel:`Show subprojects "
"filter in search modal` ，关闭搜索弹窗中的子项目过滤器。"

